  "html": "<p>OpenAI&#x27;s latest model is now available in Conductor.</p>\n<figure data-asset><img alt=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"/assets/changelog/media/0.22.1/cebf23c7-1ed2-48a8-9914-8e3d20bcf7e6.png\"/></figure>\n<p>Sub-agent tool calls will now be neatly nested in the chat.</p>\n<figure data-asset><img alt=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"/assets/changelog/media/0.22.1/55afad27-22b0-4c83-bec8-38a6523da614.png\"/></figure>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Close tabs with middle mouse click</li>\n</ul>",
  "markdown": "\nOpenAI's latest model is now available in Conductor.\n\n<img\n    width=\"474\"\n    height=\"352\"\n    alt=\"image\"\n    src=\"/assets/changelog/media/0.22.1/cebf23c7-1ed2-48a8-9914-8e3d20bcf7e6.png\"\n/>\n\nSub-agent tool calls will now be neatly nested in the chat.\n\n<img\n    width=\"1582\"\n    height=\"698\"\n    alt=\"image\"\n    src=\"/assets/changelog/media/0.22.1/55afad27-22b0-4c83-bec8-38a6523da614.png\"\n/>\n\n## Improvements\n\n- Close tabs with middle mouse click\n"
